cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  ODP-Reuse: a quality-gated benchmark of Ontology Design Pattern reuse
message: >-
  If you use this dataset or code, please cite both the software/dataset (this
  file) and the accompanying paper (see preferred-citation).
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 1.3.0
date-released: '2026-11-08'
repository-code: https://github.com/ISE-FIZKarlsruhe/ODP-Reuse
url: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17751740
abstract: >-
  Ontologies that verifiably reuse Ontology Design Patterns, published as an
  unfiltered corpus plus six quality-gated views, with the ontology-to-pattern
  mapping, per-view statistics, and a complete record of how the corpus was
  filtered. Every ontology carries a gate verdict and, where it was excluded, the
  rule and evidence for the exclusion; all removals are independently
  re-verifiable from the source files. Ships a reproducible pipeline and two
  worked use cases: ODP recommendation and automatic ODP extraction.
